CM_ "Legacy Model 3/Y, both DashKit buses. Messages DashPilot reads are unchanged, except DI_speed (full layout). The others were checked against full-bus recordings of a 2023 Model Y RWD (78 min, 2026-11-20): where the ESP32-DualCAN project's definition (Model3_CH.dbc / Model3_VEH.dbc, github.com/dzid26, CERN-OHL-W v2; see each message comment) decodes more of the car's frames with no unexplained bit, it replaces the earlier one, and messages the file lacked were added below this line. An id that is a different message on each bus has the definition that fits more frames. A name the car uses for two ids has the id as a suffix on the second. UNK_ messages: seen on the car, no public definition.";

